6️⃣ Lazy Deletion (VERY IMPORTANT SYSTEM DESIGN IDEA)
What you learn:

👉 Expired entries are removed only when accessed

if (expireTime <= currentTime) {
    this.map.delete(key);
    return -1;
}


This is called lazy expiration, used in:

Redis

Browser caches

Session stores

Why?

Avoids constant cleanup

Better performance

